L","text":"今日買ったお米の一つが、巨大胚芽米カミアカリというお米です。","ts":"1632638534.262800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"GJ7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"B291476D-4B0A-4076-9525-54F2052B807D","type":"message","user":"U843L486L","text":"白米は健康そう。今日、お米屋さんで米を買った時に小話をしたんですけど、玄米は浸しがかなり重要らしく半日から1日くらいはしたいところで、半日くらい浸して発芽しだすタイミングから旨さが発揮されるそう。数十分だけだと逆に身体に毒だそうです。:skull_and_crossbones:","ts":"1632638449.261900","edited":{"user":"U843L486L","ts":"1632638860.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Bjrp"}]},{"client_msg_id":"015fad36-451b-4187-b429-9fc6760ce18c","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"ただ、追加脂質がないとジャガイモが若干食い続けるのが辛くなりそう","ts":"1632638128.257300","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"point_up","count":1,"users":["U03C4RC8X"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"GCeCa"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a6d966df-abd3-4e99-b923-5e88ffda149e","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"むずかしい","ts":"1632638103.256800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"TgHBS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"de3a7b9e-f753-4a83-af1f-1d9684efb0ff","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"ふと思ったけど、以下の主食の中で一番体にいいのはどれだろう\n• 精白した小麦粉と塩のパンを焼いたもの\n• 精米した白米を炊いたもの\n• じゃがいもをゆでて皮を剥いたもの\nいずれも追加の脂質はないものとする","ts":"1632637865.255800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"kniy"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c23f146e-8a1f-46ff-95b1-e487ffc2282f","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"(僕のやつは50%全粒粉で作ったので色がだいぶ違うけど)","ts":"1632637412.254300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"IUt"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5de99f8c-d8db-487d-9e98-7cd09a8f1ac5","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"おー、自作","ts":"1632637402.254000","team":"T03C4RC8V","